   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Waits are the shop's policy\n(Settings → Policy, Automation).\nA shop may allow 1 call instead of 2.\n\nAn early timer, or an answer that was\nalready recorded, changes nothing.\n\nPending review = a person decides:\nship, deposit or cancel. Each order\nshows its review reason and the\nsummary of its last call.",
   "originalText": "Waits are the shop's policy\n(Settings → Policy, Automation).\nA shop may allow 1 call instead of 2.\n\nAn early timer, or an answer that was\nalready recorded, changes nothing.\n\nPending review = a person decides:\nship, deposit or cancel. Each order\nshows its review reason and the\nsummary of its last call.",
